<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="module">
  <h2>About <%= siteName %></h2>
  <div class="body">
    <p>
      This is a private social network for one group of people. It is deliberately modelled on
      MySpace circa 2005, back when your page was yours and you could put a song on it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing here is public. There is no feed ranking, no advertising, no tracking, and no way in
      without an invite code. Everything lives in one SQLite file on one server.
    </p>
    <p class="dim">
      Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to MySpace or its owners. It's a tribute.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
